Here's the correct pipeline:

```json
[
    {"$match": {"state": "closed"}},
    {
        "$group": {
            "_id": null,
            "avg_time_to_close_ms": {"$avg": {"$subtract": ["$closed_at", "$created_at"]}}
        }
    },
    {"$project": {"average_days": {"$divide": ["$avg_time_to_close_ms", 86400000]}}}
